{"id": "34368", "title": "台湾甜心", "author": "贝佳", "category": "文学名著", "count": 37, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34368.htm", "intro": "突袭个屁！简直自找罪受！来这个叫台湾的岛国就碰上颱风已够衰的了，更糟的是，他那个邀他来做公益广告的弟弟竟然不在！最后落得让个女人给他臭表情看。咦？不是听说台湾的女人都温柔体贴吗？但这个「弟弟的员工」却大大破坏了这句话的行情。是不知道他的身份、身价？还是──嘎？她超不爽外国帅哥？这又是哪门子逻辑？不过，那都不重要，重要的是──嘿嘿……因为所以、蟑螂蚂蚁，他──住进她家了……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34368", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2183455.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2183456.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2183457.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2183458.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2183459.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2183460.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2183461.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2183462.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2183463.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2183464.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2183465.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2183466.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2183467.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2183468.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2183469.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2183470.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2183471.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2183472.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2183473.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2183474.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2183475.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2183476.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2183477.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2183478.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页", "file": "2183479.html", "available": false}, {"title":